3	/**
4	 * Derives an owner's {@code ownerSegment}, a marketing segment formatted {@code "<TIER>_<AREA>"}.
5	 *
6	 * <p>{@code TIER} is {@code "PREMIUM"} when the owner's {@code membershipLevel} is
7	 * {@value #PREMIUM_LEVEL} or more, otherwise {@code "STANDARD"}. {@code AREA} is {@code "METRO"}
